      propertyPath: introText
      value: "In the Kingdom of Mailon, a vast conflict has swept the land- causing
        a disruption of the social order. You were once part of an aristocratic family,
        which ended up falling in the carnage. Thus, you turned to thievery as a
        way to get by. \r\n\r\nDuring a long trip to the west, you returned home
        to find your home destroyed, and family gone. The only thing to do is head
        into the family\u2019s crypt, still intact, and look for some sort of answer\u2026"
